# =====================================================================
# METAS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pré-requisito: ter rodado o auth.http (cria os usuários de teste).
# Rode os blocos DE CIMA PARA BAIXO.
#
# O campo "achieved" (meta atingida) não fica no banco: é calculado
# na listagem, comparando currentAmount >= targetAmount.
# O id da meta criada é guardado automaticamente (createGoal).
# =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@tokenPJ = {{loginPJ.response.body.$.access_token}}


### Login da pessoa física -> 200 (rode primeiro)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "usuario@upf.br",
    "password": "abc12345"
}

### Login da pessoa jurídica -> 200 (usado nos testes de isolamento)
# @name loginPJ
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "empresa@upf.br",
    "password": "abc12345"
}


### 1. Criar meta de 5000 -> 201 (currentAmount começa em "0")
# @name createGoal
POST {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetAmount": 5000,
    "deadline": "2027-12-31",
    "description": "Viagem de férias"
}

### 2. Prazo no passado -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetAmount": 1000,
    "deadline": "2020-01-01",
    "description": "Meta inválida"
}

### 3. Valor alvo negativo -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetAmount": -500,
    "deadline": "2027-12-31"
}

### 4. Listar -> 200, com "achieved": false
GET {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Registrar progresso: juntou 2500 -> 200
PUT {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentAmount": 2500
}

### 6. Listar -> "achieved": false (2500 de 5000)
GET {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Registrar progresso: juntou 5000 -> 200
PUT {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentAmount": 5000
}

### 8. Listar -> "achieved": true 🎯
GET {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Valor atual negativo -> 400 Bad Request
PUT {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentAmount": -10
}

### 10. Mudar o prazo para o passado -> 400 Bad Request
PUT {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "deadline": "2020-01-01"
}

### 11. Outro usuário tentando alterar a minha meta -> 404 Not Found
PUT {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPJ}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentAmount": 0
}

### 12. Outro usuário listando -> 200, lista vazia (não vê a minha meta)
GET {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPJ}}

### 13. Apagar a meta -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Apagar de novo -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{base}}/goals/{{createGoal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
